# Permissive override for the test image build. The base image's
# .dockerignore is `**/*` deny-all + explicit allows for the auth surface;
# the test image extends the base and additionally needs tests/ in the
# build context. This file overrides .dockerignore for the test build only
# (BuildKit resolves <dockerfile>.dockerignore in preference to .dockerignore).
.git/
.github/
README.md
VERSION
*.md
